[14387]="70030FBB\n1\tEncuentra a Urush\tEl líder de hueste de guerra Urush y sus secuaces han estado aterrorizando a la gente del Páramo y hay que ocuparse de ellos.\n2\tDerrota a Urush\tEl líder de hueste de guerra Urush y sus secuaces han estado aterrorizando a la gente del Páramo y hay que ocuparse de ellos.\n3\tUrush derrotado\tEl líder de hueste de guerra Urush y sus secuaces han estado aterrorizando a la gente del Páramo y hay que ocuparse de ellos.\n",
[14388]="70035921\n1\tDerrota a Varg\tTe has encontrado con Varg y su hueste de guerra. Debe ser derrotado si la paz ha de regresar al Bosque Funesto.\n2\tDerrota a Varg\tVarg se encuentra merodeando cerca de la carretera orca en el norte del Bosque Funesto. El líder uruk, Varg, debe ser derrotado antes de que pueda sembrar más caos en el Bosque Funesto.\n3\tCompletado\tHas derrotado a Varg y su hueste de guerra.\n",
[14389]="70041AB3\n1\tDefeat Vilosh and his warband\tVilosh can be found roaming the fields between Thama Aklam and the ruins of Lornost. You have encountered the vicious Haradrim rider, Vilosh, and should defeat him.\n2\tDefeat Vilosh and his warband\tVilosh can be found roaming the fields between Thama Aklam and the ruins of Lornost. You have encountered the vicious Haradrim rider, Vilosh, and should defeat him.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated Vilosh and his warband.\n",
[14390]="7003A49D\n1\tDefeat Voraut\tVoraut and his roving pack of Wargs can be found in the north-western Westfold. You should defeat Voraut.\n2\tDefeat Voraut\tVoraut and his roving pack of Wargs can be found in the north-western Westfold. You should defeat Voraut.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated Voraut and the roving Warg-pack that followed him, earning the gratitude of the people of the Westfold.\n",
